WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.937
Not as easy as I... remember.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.573
I don't like this, Richard.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.743
It's almost as if you can
almost see the spot.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:13.078
This is something right here.

00:00:13.979 --> 00:00:17.750
JAY ROSENBLATT:
<i> The bullying incident happened
 that Friday in fifth grade.</i>

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.084
<i> The more I dove into it,</i>

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:21.287
<i> the more upset I am
 that I was involved.</i>

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.690
<i> Why didn't I say stop?</i>

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.260
<i> I have to speak
 to my classmates,</i>

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:28.460
<i> whomever I can find.</i>

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.997
RICHARD:<i> I remember being
 a bit of an instigator.</i>

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.700
We all as a mass,
kept on running down the stairs

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.835
<i> and surrounded him.</i>

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:38.103
Kinda feeling guilty
to this day

00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:39.772
that I did something like that.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:44.544
Richard and I are here
to go to the 50th reunion

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.280
<i> for grade school,
 which is strange.</i>

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.115
It's morphed into
a little more than that.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:54.053
ROSENBLATT:
<i> Why do you think kids
 pick on weaker kids?</i>

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.956
SPEAKER:<i> It could be
 a sixth sense or something.</i>

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.858
SPEAKER 2:<i> Now, I probably
 was not brave enough back then</i>

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:01.293
<i> to say, "That's not fair."</i>

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.363
SPEAKER 3:<i> I remember the circle
 and the chanting.</i>

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.365
SPEAKER 4:<i> Being a bully is one
 of the most disgusting things.</i>

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.135
SPEAKER 2:
<i>I remember being really shocked
 by that kind of behavior.</i>

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:10.502
ROSENBLATT:
<i> Everyone carries pain,</i>

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:13.807
<i> yet through that pain,
 I can now see yours.</i>

